I received several comments on the best ways to find out the differences
between 4.0g and 5.1b.

The most notable areas of major changes are:
Device Management (inc SANs)
AdvFS and LSM differences
sysman/ sysman station
Event Management

Suggestions:
1. Read the release notes
2. Courses were developed by HP, Global Knowledge, and Bruden.
3. If using TruCluster, it is important to also get training on its
specific differences.
4. If possible, work closely with HP to develop a migration plan that will
work.  The rewards are especially high if using TruCluster.

