Hi all,

I got a number of responses on this one, Thanks to Jason Orendorf, Johan
Brusche, Jonathan Williams and Dr Thomas.Blinn.

Jonathan tried to rewind a tape and the system crashed. He called HP, who
invetsigated, and gave Jonathan a link to an early release patch for this.
This was back in Feb 2003.

Johan Brusche and Jason Orendorf stated it's a known problem and a proper
patch had been released for this. The URL is
http://ftp.support.compaq.com/patches/public/Readmes/unix/t64v51ab3-c0125100
-19036-e-20030623.README. This patch will be incorporated in rolled up Patch
Kit 005, which is due for release shortly. I just checked
ftp.service.digital.com, and the new rolled up patch kit hasn't been
released yet.

Alastair Munro
